  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for ceasefire implementation in Lebanon 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At a pivotal juncture, Lebanon&#x2019;s path toward recovery hinges on the ability to maintain peace, the effective extension of State authority in line with UNSC 1701, and the re-establishment of trust between public institutions and the population. This programme is a comprehensive stabilization and recovery initiative grounded in the recognition that these objectives are inseparable from the Lebanese State&#x2019;s ability to  implementation of UNSC 1701 in the South of Lebanon.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme&#x2019;s overall objective is to support the implementation of the ceasefire agreement between Lebanon and Israel through the strengthening of the Lebanese State&#x2019;s capacity to exercise state authority in line with UNSC 1701.</narrative>
  </description>
